#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:4
msgid "v4.1.6"
msgstr "v4.1.6"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.1.6 is a maintenance and examples release that refreshes all bundled "
"board firmware to OpenMV firmware 4.5.3, reorganizes the OpenMV Boards "
"examples by board family, and adds new autofocus, color-correction, Pure "
"Thermal, and OpenMV RT1060 example sets. The release remains based on Qt "
"Creator 10.0.1 (no rebase) and contains no breaking changes for user "
"projects."
msgstr ""
"v4.1.6 是一个维护和示例版本，它将所有内置开发板固件刷新至 OpenMV 固件 4.5.3，按开发板系列重新整理了 OpenMV Boards "
"示例，并新增了自动对焦、颜色校正、Pure Thermal 和 OpenMV RT1060 示例集。该版本仍基于 Qt Creator "
"10.0.1（未进行 rebase），并且对用户项目没有破坏性变更。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "亮点"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:20
msgid ""
"**OpenMV firmware 4.5.3** is now bundled, with board firmware (and, for the "
"STM32 OpenMV cameras, bootloader/uvc) images rebuilt for the OpenMV and "
"Arduino boards."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV 固件 4.5.3** 现已内置，开发板固件（对于 STM32 OpenMV 摄像头，还包括 bootloader/uvc）镜像已为 "
"OpenMV 和 Arduino 开发板重新构建。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Reorganized OpenMV Boards examples** into ``50-STM32-Boards``, ``50-IMXRT-"
"Boards``, ``51-Pure-Thermal``, and ``60-Shields`` subfolders with per-board "
"filtering so each board only sees relevant examples."
msgstr ""
"**重新整理的 OpenMV Boards 示例**\\ ：分入 ``50-STM32-Boards``\\ 、\\ ``50-IMXRT-"
"Boards``\\ 、\\ ``51-Pure-Thermal`` 和 ``60-Shields`` "
"子文件夹，并进行按开发板筛选，使每款开发板只看到相关示例。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Pure Thermal examples** added, including a thermal-over-color overlay demo"
" driving the LCD and HDMI output."
msgstr "**新增 Pure Thermal 示例**\\ ，包括一个驱动 LCD 和 HDMI 输出的热成像叠加于彩色之上的演示。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:28
msgid ""
"**OpenMV RT1060 board-control examples** added under a new ``50-IMXRT-"
"Boards`` set."
msgstr "**新增 OpenMV RT1060 板控制示例**\\ ，归入新的 ``50-IMXRT-Boards`` 集合。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Sensor autofocus** and **color-correction** examples added, demonstrating "
"``sensor.ioctl(sensor.IOCTL_TRIGGER_AUTO_FOCUS)`` and the image ``ccm()`` "
"color correction matrix method."
msgstr ""
"**新增传感器自动对焦**\\ 和\\ **颜色校正**\\ 示例，演示 "
"``sensor.ioctl(sensor.IOCTL_TRIGGER_AUTO_FOCUS)`` 和图像的 ``ccm()`` 颜色校正矩阵方法。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:35
msgid "New features"
msgstr "新功能"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:37
msgid ""
"Added a **sensor autofocus** example demonstrating "
"``sensor.ioctl(sensor.IOCTL_TRIGGER_AUTO_FOCUS)`` for cameras that support "
"autofocus (`780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."
msgstr ""
"新增了一个\\ **传感器自动对焦**\\ 示例，为支持自动对焦的摄像头演示 "
"``sensor.ioctl(sensor.IOCTL_TRIGGER_AUTO_FOCUS)``\\ （\\ `780748d66 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/780748d66>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:41
msgid ""
"Added a **color-correction** example showing the new image ``ccm()`` color "
"correction matrix method for hue/saturation shifts via YUV matrix math, "
"using ``ulab`` numpy (`780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."
msgstr ""
"新增了一个\\ **颜色校正**\\ 示例，展示新的图像 ``ccm()`` 颜色校正矩阵方法，通过 YUV 矩阵运算实现色调/饱和度偏移，使用 "
"``ulab`` numpy（\\ `780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/780748d66>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:45
msgid ""
"Added a full set of **Pure Thermal** board examples, including a thermal-"
"over-color overlay demo driving the LCD and HDMI output via "
"``fir.FIR_LEPTON``, ``display.RGBDisplay``, and ``tfp410.TFP410``, plus "
"blinky and helloworld (`780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."
msgstr ""
"新增了一整套 **Pure Thermal** 开发板示例，包括一个通过 ``fir.FIR_LEPTON``\\ 、\\ "
"``display.RGBDisplay`` 和 ``tfp410.TFP410`` 驱动 LCD 和 HDMI 输出的热成像叠加于彩色之上的演示，外加"
" blinky 和 helloworld（\\ `780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/780748d66>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:50
msgid ""
"Added a dedicated **50-IMXRT-Boards** example set for the OpenMV RT1060 with"
" ADC, CAN, I2C, LED/PWM, motor control, pin, PWM, RTC, servo, SPI, switch, "
"timer, UART, and watchdog board-control scripts (`780748d66 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."
msgstr ""
"为 OpenMV RT1060 新增了专门的 **50-IMXRT-Boards** 示例集，包含 "
"ADC、CAN、I2C、LED/PWM、电机控制、引脚、PWM、RTC、舵机、SPI、开关、定时器、UART 和看门狗等板控制脚本（\\ "
"`780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/780748d66>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:56
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "其他变更与改进"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:58
msgid ""
"Updated all bundled board firmware to **OpenMV firmware 4.5.3**, rebuilding "
"the firmware images for the OpenMV and Arduino boards (with bootloader and "
"uvc images rebuilt only for the STM32 OpenMV cameras) (`780748d66 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."
msgstr ""
"将所有内置开发板固件更新至 **OpenMV 固件 4.5.3**\\ ，为 OpenMV 和 Arduino "
"开发板重新构建了固件镜像（bootloader 和 uvc 镜像仅为 STM32 OpenMV 摄像头重新构建）（\\ `780748d66 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/780748d66>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:62
msgid ""
"Reorganized the OpenMV Boards examples into ``50-STM32-Boards``, ``50-IMXRT-"
"Boards``, ``51-Pure-Thermal``, and ``60-Shields`` subfolders with per-board "
"filtering, moving many board-control and shield scripts into the appropriate"
" family (`780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."
msgstr ""
"将 OpenMV Boards 示例重新整理到 ``50-STM32-Boards``\\ 、\\ ``50-IMXRT-Boards``\\ 、\\ "
"``51-Pure-Thermal`` 和 ``60-Shields`` 子文件夹中，并进行按开发板筛选，将许多板控制和扩展板脚本移到相应的系列中（\\"
" `780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/780748d66>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:67
msgid ""
"Hid the HelloWorld blinky/helloworld examples on the Pure Thermal board and "
"added STM32 low-power examples (``deep_sleep``, ``sensor_sleep``, "
"``stop_mode``) (`780748d66 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."
msgstr ""
"在 Pure Thermal 开发板上隐藏了 HelloWorld 的 blinky/helloworld 示例，并新增了 STM32 低功耗示例（\\"
" ``deep_sleep``\\ 、\\ ``sensor_sleep``\\ 、\\ ``stop_mode``\\ ）（\\ `780748d66"
" <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/780748d66>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:71
msgid ""
"Removed the ``cartoon_filter`` example and dropped the ``person_detection`` "
"built-in-model callback from the RPC Remote-Control popular-features "
"examples (``08-RPC-Library/34-Remote-Control``), following removal of the "
"bundled ``person_detection`` model in firmware 4.5.3, and updated several "
"recording, drawing, WiFi, and MQTT examples (`780748d66 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/780748d66>`__)."
msgstr ""
"移除了 ``cartoon_filter`` 示例，并在固件 4.5.3 移除内置 ``person_detection`` 模型后，从 RPC "
"Remote-Control 热门功能示例（\\ ``08-RPC-Library/34-Remote-Control``\\ ）中删除了 "
"``person_detection`` 内置模型回调，同时更新了若干录制、绘制、WiFi 和 MQTT 示例（\\ `780748d66 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/780748d66>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:79
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "错误修复"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:81
msgid ""
"Fixed the Chinese (``zh_CN`` and ``zh_TW``) \"All Files\" file-dialog filter"
" translation that used fullwidth characters, restoring the working ASCII "
"``(*.*)`` pattern in Open/Save dialogs (`cecfda3b7 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/cecfda3b7>`__)."
msgstr ""
"修复了使用全角字符的中文（\\ ``zh_CN`` 和 ``zh_TW``\\ ）“所有文件”文件对话框筛选器翻译，恢复了打开/保存对话框中可用的 "
"ASCII ``(*.*)`` 模式（\\ `cecfda3b7 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/cecfda3b7>`__\\ ）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:87
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "平台与工具支持"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:89
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 10.0.1."
msgstr "**Qt Creator 基线：** 10.0.1。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:90
msgid ""
"**OpenMV firmware:** updated from 4.5.2 to 4.5.3. ``OPENMV2/3/4/4P/PT`` "
"received full firmware + bootloader + uvc rebuilds; "
"``ARDUINO_GIGA``/``PORTENTA_H7``/``NICLA_VISION`` received firmware + uvc; "
"``ARDUINO_NANO_RP2040_CONNECT`` and the Nano 33 BLE Sense received firmware "
"only; ``OPENMV_RT1060`` received ``firmware.bin`` only. The Nano 33 BLE "
"Sense ``boards.txt`` identifier was normalized to "
"``ARDUINO_NANO_33_BLE_SENSE``."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV 固件：** 从 4.5.2 更新至 4.5.3。\\ ``OPENMV2/3/4/4P/PT`` 进行了完整的固件 + "
"bootloader + uvc 重新构建；\\ ``ARDUINO_GIGA``/``PORTENTA_H7``/``NICLA_VISION`` "
"进行了固件 + uvc 重新构建；\\ ``ARDUINO_NANO_RP2040_CONNECT`` 和 Nano 33 BLE Sense "
"仅重新构建了固件；\\ ``OPENMV_RT1060`` 仅重新构建了 ``firmware.bin``\\ 。Nano 33 BLE Sense 的"
" ``boards.txt`` 标识符被规范化为 ``ARDUINO_NANO_33_BLE_SENSE``\\ 。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:97
msgid ""
"**CYW4343 WiFi firmware:** metadata added for CYW43 WiFi FW 7.45.98.50 "
"(``CYW43_WIFI_FW_LEN`` 383110, ``CYW43_CLM_LEN`` 7222)."
msgstr ""
"**CYW4343 WiFi 固件：** 新增了 CYW43 WiFi FW 7.45.98.50 的元数据（\\ "
"``CYW43_WIFI_FW_LEN`` 383110，\\ ``CYW43_CLM_LEN`` 7222）。"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:101
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "破坏性变更"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.1.6.rst:103
msgid ""
"None. This release is fully compatible with existing projects; the Qt "
"Creator base is unchanged."
msgstr "无。本次发布与现有项目完全兼容；Qt Creator 基线未改变。"
